<span id="S4.F8.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.F8.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Context:</span><span id="S4.F8.pic1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 
The 33-year-old has featured only twice for the Foxes this
term, having signed a new one-year deal with the Premier League newcomers in the
summer. Former Blackpool forward Taylor-Fletcher scored three goals in 23 games
for his parent club last season. He joined the 13th-placed Owls prior to
Saturday’s Championship game against Norwich City.</span></span>
