<p id="A8.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mixing Coarse Representations from Different Stories.</span>
We encode pairs of 128-token stories from TinyStories with the VQ-VAE, mix their
coarse representations, and use NCM to generate the remaining finer levels
conditioned on the mixture. Figure <a href="#A8.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ Appendix H Probing the Hierarchy ‣ N C M Next-Concept Modeling: Fast, Parallel Coarse-to-Fine Text Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a> shows two source
